### ============================================================
### Agent 引擎 API -- Agent / AgentAdmin / Version / Graph / NodeType
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

# @name Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ username:admin,password:admin123}

### 1. Agent 列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/list
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 2. Agent 分页 (管理端)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/agent/page?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 3. Agent 详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/agent/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 4. 执行 Agent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/1/execute
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

{inputs:{message:hello},sessionId:test-01}

### 5. 节点类型
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/agent/node-types
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 6. 版本列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/agent/1/version
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 7. Graph 配置
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/agent/1/version/1/graph
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
